      "level": {
        "value": 18
      },
      "publicNotes": "<h2>Appearance</h2>\n<p>A compact fey with curling ram's horns, glowing green eyes and a sharp, amused smile. Sileth wears leaf-green leathers and holds a scimitar of crystallised green force. A shard of the same crystal glows in the other hand. Green threads are knotted around both wrists.</p>",
      "privateNotes": "<p><strong>@UUID[Compendium.points-of-interest.journals.JournalEntry.jxn9bB1XhZTRpF65.JournalEntryPage.oZ23BnjhOFOnIP6B]{The Scout's Wager}.</strong> Wild Hunt scout hunting anyone carrying royal goods. Gives the PCs one round to run, then fires Befuddle beams and closes with the Crystal Scimitar, whose wounding and keen runes make her quarry bleed and turn a hit on a natural 19 into a critical hit. Calls a truce if half the hunt falls.</p>"
    },
